{"id": "S0001", "offset": 0, "section": "abstract", "text": "摘要"}
{"id": "S0002", "offset": 3, "section": "abstract", "text": "本试点研究开发了一种低温等离子体表面处理工艺。"}
{"id": "S0003", "offset": 26, "section": "abstract", "text": "实验表明该工艺显著提高材料的亲水性，并证明其可延长植入体使用寿命。"}
{"id": "S0004", "offset": 59, "section": "abstract", "text": "接触角数据见图3。"}
{"id": "S0005", "offset": 70, "section": "introduction", "text": "引言"}
{"id": "S0006", "offset": 73, "section": "introduction", "text": "植入体表面性能决定其生物相容性。"}
{"id": "S0007", "offset": 89, "section": "introduction", "text": "本文拟回答低温处理能否在不损伤基体的前提下改善表面能。"}
{"id": "S0008", "offset": 118, "section": "methods", "text": "方法"}
{"id": "S0009", "offset": 121, "section": "methods", "text": "以钛片为基体，氩气等离子体处理 5 分钟。"}
{"id": "S0010", "offset": 142, "section": "methods", "text": "每组 3 个样本，测量接触角。"}
{"id": "S0011", "offset": 159, "section": "results", "text": "结果"}
{"id": "S0012", "offset": 162, "section": "results", "text": "处理组接触角由 78° 降至 32°。"}
{"id": "S0013", "offset": 181, "section": "results", "text": "处理前后质量无可见变化。"}
{"id": "S0014", "offset": 195, "section": "discussion", "text": "讨论"}
{"id": "S0015", "offset": 198, "section": "discussion", "text": "接触角的下降表明表面能提高。"}
{"id": "S0016", "offset": 212, "section": "discussion", "text": "该工艺证明了其在临床植入体延寿中的应用价值。"}
{"id": "S0017", "offset": 236, "section": "references", "text": "参考文献"}
{"id": "S0018", "offset": 241, "section": "references", "text": "[1] Wang et al., 表面工程, 2019."}
